= Chen Jiongming joins the Public Interest Party
  
After Chen Jiongming was defeated by our NRA, he was forced to flee to Hong Kong. It seems Chen Jiongming has finally found his home in the *Public Interest Party* (Zhi Gong), with their congress in San Francisco.

- @next: Continue...

@next
face-image: img/federalism.webp
  
This "China Zhi Gong" Party is mostly made of overseas Chinese, they advocate for multi-party democracy, and the idea of *Federalism* in China, an idea we simply disagree with. But, atleast the traitor is no longer our problem.
